  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Social Assistance System Modernization Project is a World Bank loan to Ukraine equal to USD 99.40 million. The Bank has requested Sida to make an additional contribution to the project by cofinancing a policy component worth USD 3.9 million. The documents have been scrutinized with the help of Ramboll Management/Thomas Bjornkilde (Sida Framework agreement 2005-002952).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">V&#xE4;rldsbanken har f&#xF6;rberett ett Social Assistance System Modernization Project-l&#xE5;n till Ukraina p&#xE5; USD 99.40 miljoner. Banken har bett Sida samfinansiera ytterligare en komponent p&#xE5; USD 3.9 miljoner f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;rst&#xE4;rka policydelen av l&#xE5;net. Dokumenten har granskats med hj&#xE4;lp av Ramboll Management/Thomas Bjornkilde (Sidas ramavtal 2005-002952).</narrative>
  </description>
